      "text": "Rosie. He told me: be gentle with Rosie, she's carrying my whole life.",
      "pt": "Rosie. Ele me disse: cuidado com a Rosie, ela está carregando a minha vida inteira.",
      "audio": "talk/town/s04-04-the-doctor-with-dirty-hands/329f66feda32.mp3",
