      "text": "Thursday: the angriest client Kettle has. But first, Wednesday. The day Helen chooses between the bug and the stamps.",
      "pt": "Quinta: a cliente mais brava da Kettle. Mas antes, quarta. O dia em que a Helen escolhe entre o bug e os selos.",
      "audio": "talk/town/s10-04-honest-feedback/6de1034b5be6.mp3",
